+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+This project's current recorded decision requires TLS certificate verification on all builds, including development builds. An earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification in development builds was explicitly reversed in favor of a consistent security posture across dev, staging, and production, and this stance was further reinforced by the subsequent HTTPS Everywhere policy, which mandates encrypted connections with no exceptions.
